    <string name="gesture_recognize">Gesture Recognition</string>
    <string name="gesture_tip">First, position your right fist in the center of camera, then open your palm. Once you hear a sound from robot, move your hand in one direction (up, down, right, or left) for a specific distance. Note that you should keep your palm open throughout this process. Then, make a fist again. As robot recognizes your movement, it will emit another sound and begin to move accordingly.</string>
    <string name="gesture_tips1">Note: For better recognition, please hold your palm toward the camera. The interval between each round of recognition is 5s.</string>
    <string name="gesture_tips10">2. Dynamic Gestures:Spread your fingers (recognized as ”five”), then draw a line (yellow track appears). To stop, make a fist.Robot moves according to the drawn path: swipe up/down/left/right to control forward/backward/left/right movement.</string>
    <string name="gesture_tips2">"After the game starts, Robot can recognize static gesture and dynamic gesture. 
1. Static gesture
 You can make finger heart, OK and fist gesture. Having recognized them, Robot will execute corresponding actions.
2. Dynamic gesture
 Firstly open your hand. Then only extend index finger when Robot recognizes “five”. When it recognizes “one”, draw the line with index finger, and the red line trace will simultaneously show up. Having finished, open your hand to indicate the end of drawing. You can swipe left, right, upward and downward to make Robot move left, right, forward and backward respectively. And Robot will move a few steps, and then stop."</string>
    <string name="gesture_tips2_2">"After the game starts, Robot can recognize static gesture. 
You can make finger heart, OK and fist gesture. Having recognized them, Robot will execute corresponding actions."</string>
    <string name="gesture_tips3">Note: The robot recognizes gestures with the right hand. For best results, keep the palm facing the camera.</string>
    <string name="gesture_tips4">"After the game starts, ROSpider can recognize static gesture and dynamic gesture. 
1. Static Gestures:"</string>
    <string name="gesture_tips5">Thumbs up sign</string>
